{"book":"ezekiel","model":"glm-4.5","timestamp":"2026-05-03T12:31:13.701683631Z","verse":15,"ref":"ezekiel 31:15","tier":"bulk","chapter":31,"translation":"Thus said ⟨the⟩ Adonai YHWH, In ⟨the⟩ day ⟨of⟩ his going down to ⟨the⟩ grave I have caused ⟨a⟩ mourning, I have covered ⟨the⟩ deep for him, and I have restrained his rivers, and ⟨the⟩ great waters were stopped, and I have caused Lebanon to mourn for him, and all ⟨the⟩ trees of ⟨the⟩ field ⟨are⟩ mourned ⟨את⟩⟨the⟩ deep for him.","tokens":[{"surface":"כה","gloss":"Thus"},{"surface":"אמר","gloss":"said"},{"surface":"אדני","gloss":"⟨the⟩ Adonai"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"YHWH"},{"surface":"ביום","gloss":"In ⟨the⟩ day ⟨of⟩"},{"surface":"רדתו","gloss":"his going down"},{"surface":"שאולה","gloss":"to ⟨the⟩ grave"},{"surface":"האבלתי","gloss":"I have caused ⟨a⟩ mourning"},{"surface":"כסתי","gloss":"I have covered"},{"surface":"עליו","gloss":"for him"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"⟨the⟩ deep"},{"surface":"תהום","gloss":"⟨the⟩ deep"},{"surface":"ואמנע","gloss":"and I have restrained"},{"surface":"נהרותיה","gloss":"his rivers"},{"surface":"ויכלאו","gloss":"and ⟨the⟩ great waters were stopped"},{"surface":"מים","gloss":"waters"},{"surface":"רבים","gloss":"great"},{"surface":"ואקדר","gloss":"and I have caused Lebanon to mourn"},{"surface":"עליו","gloss":"for him"},{"surface":"לבנון","gloss":"Lebanon"},{"surface":"וכל","gloss":"and all"},{"surface":"עצי","gloss":"⟨the⟩ trees"},{"surface":"השדה","gloss":"of ⟨the⟩ field"},{"surface":"עליו","gloss":"for him"},{"surface":"עלפה","gloss":"⟨are⟩ mourned"}]}